    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB1LC_1LA1RB_0LD0LD_0RA1LC p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB1LC_1LA1RB_0LD0LD_0RA1LC p j' E).
    + lia.
